===Etymology===
From {{uder|sq|ine-pro|*h₂oren}}, {{m|ine-pro|*h₃eren}}, {{m|ine-pro|*h₃érō }}. Cognates include {{cog|sla-pro|*orьlъ}}, and {{cog|grc|ὄρνις}}. The form {{m|sq|orrll}} has been influenced by the Slavic term. The form {{m|sq|orrl}} is derived from the Slavic term.<ref>{{R:sq:Orel:2000|page=59}}</ref>

